{"paper": "CHSL-Tier1-11-Jul-2024-Shift3.pdf", "status": "ok", "mode": "sequential", "splitter": "qdot", "section_slice": true, "extracted_count": 25, "tagged_count": 25, "questions": [{"n": 1, "text": "Study the following graph and answer the question that follows. The following bar graph shows the percentage profit earned by two companies A and B over the given years. The incomes of two companies A and B in 2006 were in the ratio 3 : 4, respectively. What was the respective ratio of their expenditures in 2006?", "options": [{"text": "14 : 19", "added": false}, {"text": "7 : 22", "added": false}, {"text": "27 : 35", "added": false}, {"text": "15 : 22", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Data Interpretation", "sub": "bar-graph", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 2, "text": "Shantanu’s income decreased from ₹42,800 to ₹37,236. Find the percentage decrease in his income.", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": false, "topic": "Percentage", "sub": "income-expenditure", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 3, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 4, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "117.6 lakhs", "added": false}, {"text": "78.4 lakhs", "added": false}, {"text": "201.6 lakhs", "added": false}, {"text": "130.67 lakhs", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 5, "text": "A shopkeeper sold an article at a 26% profit. On selling it for ₹2,250 more, he would get a profit of 41%. If this article is sold at 12% profit, then the selling price would be:", "options": [{"text": "₹16,800", "added": false}, {"text": "₹15,000", "added": false}, {"text": "₹15,800", "added": false}, {"text": "₹16,120", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Profit-Loss", "sub": "basic-cp-sp", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 6, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "4000", "added": false}, {"text": "40", "added": false}, {"text": "400", "added": false}, {"text": "4", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 7, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "3 : 1", "added": false}, {"text": "3 : 2", "added": false}, {"text": "2 : 3", "added": false}, {"text": "1 : 3", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 8, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 9, "text": "In how many years will a sum of ₹4,250 yield a simple interest of ₹510 at a rate of 6% per annum?", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": false, "topic": "Simple Interest", "sub": "si-formula", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 10, "text": "Teena does half of a task in 6 days. Later, with Shyam’s help, she completes the remaining work in 4 days. Shyam alone can finish the entire work in:", "options": [{"text": "21 days", "added": false}, {"text": "24 days", "added": false}, {"text": "18 days", "added": false}, {"text": "12 days", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Time-Work", "sub": "efficiency", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 11, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "9 cm", "added": false}, {"text": "13 cm", "added": false}, {"text": "15 cm", "added": false}, {"text": "12 cm", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 12, "text": "In two successive years, 75 and 50 employees of a company appeared at the departmental examination. Respectively, 84% and 52% of them passed. The average rate of pass percentage is:", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": false, "topic": "Percentage", "sub": "marks-and-exam", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 13, "text": "Let C be a circle with center O and PQ be the diameter of C. Let AB be a chord on C. If ∠ QOB = 40°, ∠ AOP = 80°, then find ∠ AOB.", "options": [{"text": "100°", "added": false}, {"text": "60°", "added": false}, {"text": "90°", "added": false}, {"text": "70°", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Circles-Polygons", "sub": "tangents-and-chords", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 14, "text": "The sum of the present ages of a father and son is 50 years. If after 5 years, the father’s age will be 5 times the age of the son, then what was the father’s age 5 years ago?", "options": [{"text": "36", "added": false}, {"text": "47", "added": false}, {"text": "43", "added": false}, {"text": "40", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Ages", "sub": "present-age", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 15, "text": "If 640 ÷ 8 + 930 ÷ 15 – k + 32 × 5 = 1104 ÷ 16 × 148 ÷ 37, then the value of k is:", "options": [{"text": "276", "added": false}, {"text": "26", "added": false}, {"text": "35", "added": false}, {"text": "302", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "bodmas", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 16, "text": "Find the whole surface area of a cuboid having a length of 19 cm, breadth of 9 cm and height of 4.5 cm.", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": false, "topic": "Mensuration 3D", "sub": "cube-cuboid", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 17, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 18, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "16 cm", "added": false}, {"text": "18 cm", "added": false}, {"text": "14 cm", "added": false}, {"text": "12 cm", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 19, "text": "", "options": [{"text": "6", "added": false}, {"text": "4", "added": false}, {"text": "5", "added": false}, {"text": "3", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 20, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 21, "text": "There are two circles touching each other externally. The radius of the first circle with centre O is 12 cm. The radius of the second circle with centre A is 5 cm. Find the length of their common tangent touching the two circles at points P and Q.", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": false, "topic": "Circles-Polygons", "sub": "tangents-and-chords", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 22, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 23, "text": "", "options": [], "options_source": "missing", "image_only": true, "topic": "Simplification", "sub": "other", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 24, "text": "If the speed of a boat in still water is 3 km/h and if its speed upstream is 1 km/h, find the speed of the stream.", "options": [{"text": "2 km/h", "added": false}, {"text": "1 km/h", "added": false}, {"text": "0.25 km/h", "added": false}, {"text": "0.5 km/h", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Boats-Streams", "sub": "upstream-downstream", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 25, "text": "The surface area of a spherical ball is 1386 cm2. What will be its volume?", "options": [{"text": "4825 cm3", "added": false}, {"text": "5000 cm3", "added": false}, {"text": "4851 cm3", "added": false}, {"text": "4800 cm3", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Mensuration 2D", "sub": "paths-and-borders", "key_answer": null}]}